// A small Public Suffix List in the format of
// https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat, for the import task's cases.

// A rule before any section has no section.
before.example

// ===BEGIN ICANN DOMAINS===

// ac : https://www.nic.ac/
// Confirmed by registry <admin@nic.ac>
ac
com.ac

// com : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.com
com

// ck : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.ck
*.ck
!www.ck

// uk : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/.uk
uk
co.uk
// A rule given twice keeps its first place and its last comments.
ac

// The line below is "0", which PHP's empty() skips.
0
// 公司.cn : a rule in UTF-8
公司.cn

// ===END ICANN DOMAINS===
between.example
// ===BEGIN PRIVATE DOMAINS===

// GitHub, Inc.
github.io
//no space after the slashes: a rule, not a comment
===BEGIN ICANN DOMAINS=== at the start of a line is not a marker

// ===END PRIVATE DOMAINS===
after.example
